{
  "_comment": [
    "Sound ids and the files behind them. Ids are authored first, with the code that plays them;",
    "AudioDirector treats an empty path as 'this sound has no file yet' and returns silently, so a",
    "call site can be written now and becomes audible the moment a file lands here.",
    "",
    "The files are rendered from FamiTracker modules by tools/build_music.py (audio/README.md):",
    "audio/sfx/<id>.txt, audio/music/<id>.txt and audio/ambience/<id>.txt. Music and ambience loop;",
    "sfx do not. A missing file warns once at load, not once per play.",
    "",
    "spacing: id -> the least seconds between two plays of that sound effect, for the ones made",
    "constantly (a footstep), so they cannot take every voice from the sounds that carry information."
